  "post_content": "<p>(15 fotos) Mar&iacute;a Dolores Cotol&iacute; Mor, m&aacute;s conocida como &lsquo;T&iacute;a Irene&acute;, se ha convertido en la primera centenaria de Espadilla.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/06/DSC9444.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 321px;\" /></p>\n<p>Por ese motivo el domingo recibi&oacute; el homenaje del Ayuntamiento, encabezado por la alcaldesa, Mar&iacute;a Teresa Marco Cons, y de todo el pueblo,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/06/ESPADILLA.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 329px;\" /></p>\n<p>mientras que el lunes fue el turno del presidente de la Diputaci&oacute;n Provincial de Castell&oacute;n, Javier Moliner Gargallo.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/homenajeespadillacentenariatiairene/1.jpg\" alt=\"1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/homenajeespadillacentenariatiairene/dsc9384.jpg\" alt=\"dsc9384\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/homenajeespadillacentenariatiairene/dsc9397.jpg\" alt=\"dsc9397\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/homenajeespadillacentenariatiairene/dsc9402.jpg\" alt=\"dsc9402\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/homenajeespadillacentenariatiairene/dsc9405.jpg\" alt=\"dsc9405\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/homenajeespadillacentenariatiairene/dsc9410.jpg\" alt=\"dsc9410\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/homenajeespadillacentenariatiairene/dsc9414.jpg\" alt=\"dsc9414\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/homenajeespadillacentenariatiairene/dsc9417.jpg\" alt=\"dsc9417\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/homenajeespadillacentenariatiairene/dsc9431.jpg\" alt=\"dsc9431\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/homenajeespadillacentenariatiairene/dsc9439.jpg\" alt=\"dsc9439\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/homenajeespadillacentenariatiairene/dsc9444.jpg\" alt=\"dsc9444\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/homenajeespadillacentenariatiairene/dsc9460.jpg\" alt=\"dsc9460\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/homenajeespadillacentenariatiairene/dsc9464.jpg\" alt=\"dsc9464\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/homenajeespadillacentenariatiairene/dsc9465.jpg\" alt=\"dsc9465\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/homenajeespadillacentenariatiairene/espadilla.jpg\" alt=\"espadilla\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
